From 6c31a5cb200976f1c29c04b40832329e634c528b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: phlink <phlink@local>
Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 21:24:15 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] phlink: phase 9 plan 09-01 phlink_crypto FFI (Argon2id +
 XChaCha20-Poly1305)

Vendor argon2 0.5, chacha20poly1305 0.10, and supporting RustCrypto crates
via gnrt; expose them through a cxx::bridge in chrome/browser/phlink/portability.

C++ surface: phlink::portability::DeriveKey / AeadSeal / AeadOpen with
RFC 9106 default Argon2id params (m=64MiB, t=3, p=1) and XChaCha20-Poly1305
AEAD. Foundations for plans 09-02 (export) and 09-03 (import).

Adds phlink_crypto_unittests (round-trip + KDF determinism) and wires it
into //:rust_build_tests.
