+
+[#467]: https://github.com/RustCrypto/AEADs/pull/467
+
+## 0.10.0 (2022-07-31)
+### Added
+- `getrandom` feature ([#446])
+- Impl `ZeroizeOnDrop` for `ChaChaPoly1305` ([#447])
